---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Stamp from '../components/Stamp.astro';
---

<Layout tone="180dc" title="180DC" description="Lakshya Tiwari's 180 Degrees Consulting journey.">
  <article class="prose">
    <Stamp label="180DC" date="Since Sep 2024" ink="var(--dc-green-deep)" shape="oval" tilt={3} />
    <h1>Consulting for social impact.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      My journey with <a href="https://www.180dc.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        >180 Degrees Consulting</a
      >, the world’s largest consultancy for nonprofits and social enterprises, from founding a
      branch to the Global Leadership Team.
    </p>

    <h2>Founding 180DC NIT Warangal</h2>
    <p class="role">Founder and Director of Clients & Outreach, Sep 2024</p>
    <p>
      I set up the 180DC branch at NIT Warangal, which was named Best New Branch in APAC. We
      onboarded eight clients, including Labourhome, Ecosaviours, Storelink and Feeding India by
      Zomato, working on impact measurement, market sizing, growth, GTM and pricing.
    </p>

    <h2>Global Leadership Team</h2>
    <p class="muted">Coming soon.</p>

    <h2>Branch Pairing</h2>
    <p class="muted">Coming soon.</p>

    <h2>Passion projects</h2>
    <p class="muted">Coming soon.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  article > :global(.stamp) {
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  h2 {
    color: #2b2f33;
  }
</style>
